      "writtenOn": "2024-05-14T21:57:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Daisuke -- I think this is the correct behavior:\n\n* Alert should clear cached conn status\n* Next successful conn status should get cached\n* All subsequent conn status reads from cached until alert is processed again\n\nAlerts don\u0027t get handled while a command is being executed (I.e. state !\u003d ST_IDLE) so ordering should be correctly preserved.",
      "parentUuid": "d064b72f_06976e89",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1284,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1284,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "4e1ebd39ed2d0460b65955d73c4ab03ad044251d",
