        "id": 1365249
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T16:52:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There shouldn\u0027t be. Both the interrupt handler and command execution occur on the same thread and the PPM initiated synchronous tasks also post + run on that thread.\n\nSee https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/usbc/pdc_rts54xx.c;l\u003d2500",
      "parentUuid": "2995c93f_c553aa89",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1284,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1284,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "4e1ebd39ed2d0460b65955d73c4ab03ad044251d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f2bce33f_4647efd7",
