        "id": 1365249
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-16T23:51:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "State machine runs on rts54xx_thread: https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/usbc/pdc_rts54xx.c;l\u003d2536\n\npdc_execute_command_sync calls `rts54_post_cmd` puts the command data into the buffer and waits for the PDC thread to pick it up here: https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/usbc/pdc_rts54xx.c;l\u003d913?q\u003dpdc_rts54xx.c\n\nSo both interrupt handler and command handling both run on the same `rts54xx_thread`",
